view or chemistry screens end-to-end (only the estimate-label test and scope-lines test exist). This is a minor coverage gap but reasonable given the TUI is not a stable API surface.","The overview screen's hardware panel inserts 3 scope lines, which may cause visual overflow on very small terminals. This is a known aesthetic tradeoff documented in prior review output."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[],"outcome":"approved"},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"2e807f2f-c276-4fbc-a136-2103cd9aaa06"}
